   <text type="letter">
      
      <body>
         <div type="writingSession">
            <pb n="1"/>
            <opener><dateline><date when="1943-12-31">Dec.31 1943</date></dateline>
               <salute>Dear <rs ref="#tillich_person_id__1928" type="person">Dr.
                  Tillich</rs>,</salute>
            </opener>
            <p><rs ref="#tillich_person_id__4026" type="person">Dr. Zucker</rs> thought that the New School – (<rs ref="#tillich_person_id__2423"
                  type="person">Dr. Johnson</rs> and the faculty) – would be interested in
               purchasing the portrait that I did of the late <rs ref="#tillich_person_id__2044" type="person">Max
                  Wertheimer</rs>. <rs ref="#tillich_person_id__4026" type="person">Zucker</rs> took a photo of the picture
               to the New School.</p>
            <p>But he advised me to get in touch with you because your opinion would be highly valuated at 
            the N. School.</p>
            <p>As we wanted very much to see you and <rs ref="#tillich_person_id__1923" type="person">Mrs.
               Tillich</rs> again, we like to find out, if you are free on Sunday afternoon Jan. 2<hi rend="above">nd</hi><pb n="2"/></p>
            <p>We should be very glad if you would come over around 4 P.M.</p>
            <p>Besides showing you the <rs ref="#tillich_person_id__2044" type="person">Wertheimer</rs> portrait I would be glad to show you some of my 
            recent paintings.</p>
            <closer>
               <salute>With best wishes for a happy New Year to all of you – also on behalf of <rs
                  ref="#tillich_person_id__4368" type="person">Elizabeth</rs>– I am cordially yours,</salute>
               <signed><rs ref="#tillich_person_id__4367" type="person">Arthur
                  Kaufmann</rs></signed><lb/>Tel. CA-8-9530-<lb/>
               <hi rend="underline">show</hi> 414 St. 121<hi rend="above">th</hi> Std <hi rend="underline">show</hi>
               switchboard-service </closer>
         </div>
      </body>
   </text>
